    <bpmn:process id="W_W1945" name="W1945. Consignment &amp; VMI Dashboard &amp; Executive Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly reporting cycle
Frequency: Monthly dashboard; quarterly executive report
Volume: Consolidated across all consignment &amp; VMI operations
Owner: VP Supply Chain
Participants: VP Supply Chain, Category Manager, CFO
Source: workflow W1945 — Consignment &amp; VMI Dashboard &amp; Executive Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1945_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1945_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1945_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1945_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1945_Lane2" name="VP Supply Chain">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1945_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1945_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1945_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1945_Start4" name="Monthly reporting cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1945_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1945_Task5" name="Monthly dashboard generation: (a) consignment: total consignment inventory…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Monthly dashboard generation: (a) consignment: total consignment inventory value (vendor-owned), sell-through rate, settlement accuracy, aging distribution, (b) VMI: total VMI inventory value (BuildRight-owned), fill rate, stockout rate, overstock rate, vendor compliance score, (c) combined: total consignment + VMI inventory as % of total inventory, total margin contribution, vendor count, SKU count
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1945_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1945_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1945_Task6" name="VP Supply Chain reviews dashboard: (a) identify trends, (b) flag exceptions for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: VP Supply Chain reviews dashboard: (a) identify trends, (b) flag exceptions for action, (c) distribute to Category Managers and Finance Manager
Responsible (R): VP Supply Chain
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1945_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1945_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1945_Task7" name="Quarterly: VP Supply Chain presents executive report to CFO and VP…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Quarterly: VP Supply Chain presents executive report to CFO and VP Merchandising: (a) program health: is consignment/VMI creating value?, (b) vendor performance: which vendors to expand, reduce, or terminate?, (c) financial impact: margin contribution, carrying cost, capital savings, (d) strategic recommendations
Responsible (R): VP Supply Chain
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 day/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1945_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1945_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1945_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
