    <bpmn:process id="W_W1949" name="W1949. Consignment &amp; VMI Audit Trail &amp; Compliance Documentation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Ongoing; annual audit preparation
Frequency: Continuous audit trail; annual documentation review
Volume: All consignment &amp; VMI transactions
Owner: Accounting Manager
Participants: Accounting Manager, Internal Auditor, External Auditor
Source: workflow W1949 — Consignment &amp; VMI Audit Trail &amp; Compliance Documentation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1949_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1949_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1949_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1949_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1949_Lane2" name="Accounting Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1949_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1949_Lane3" name="Internal Auditor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1949_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1949_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1949_Start5" name="Ongoing; annual audit preparation">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1949_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1949_Task6" name="System maintains continuous audit trail: (a) consignment: receipt → display →…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System maintains continuous audit trail: (a) consignment: receipt → display → sale → ownership transfer → settlement, with timestamps, user IDs, and system references, (b) VMI: data sharing → replenishment → receipt → auto-confirmation → payment, with full traceability, (c) adjustments: damage, shrinkage, returns — all documented with reason codes and approvals
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Accounting Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1949_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1949_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1949_Task7" name="Annual: Accounting Manager prepares consignment &amp; VMI documentation for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Annual: Accounting Manager prepares consignment &amp; VMI documentation for external audit: (a) consignment inventory is vendor-owned — excluded from BuildRight&#x27;s balance sheet inventory; provide vendor ownership documentation, (b) VMI inventory is BuildRight-owned — included in balance sheet at WAC; provide VMI agreement terms for audit review, (c) settlement reconciliation: consignment settlements matched to sell-through, VMI payments matched to GR, (d) provide sample of transactions for auditor testing
Responsible (R): Accounting Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2–3 days/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1949_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1949_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1949_Task8" name="Internal audit of consignment &amp; VMI per W21: (a) verify consignment stock is…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Internal audit of consignment &amp; VMI per W21: (a) verify consignment stock is correctly classified (not inadvertently included in owned inventory valuation), (b) verify VMI stock levels per physical count, (c) test settlement accuracy on sample basis, (d) review vendor agreements for compliance with BuildRight policies
Responsible (R): Internal Auditor
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per annual audit plan</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1949_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1949_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1949_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1949_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-378 (ensure controlled execution — Consignment &amp; VMI Settlement &amp; Analytics (PA-45.3).) | - operational: must strictly enforce non-valuated treatment
Owner: Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1949_Assoc11" sourceRef="W1949_Annotation10" targetRef="W1949_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
